WEBVTT

00:12:27.729 --> 00:12:30.126
"Do you want slim fit,
easy fit, relaxed fit?

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:33.512
You want button fly or zipper fly?
You want stonewashed or acid-washed?

00:12:33.536 --> 00:12:34.919
Do you want them distressed?

00:12:34.943 --> 00:12:38.178
Do you want boot cut, tapered?"
Blah, blah, blah on and on he went.

00:12:38.202 --> 00:12:39.704
My jaw dropped.

00:12:39.728 --> 00:12:41.255
And after I recovered, I said,

00:12:41.279 --> 00:12:44.405
"I want the kind that used to be
the only kind."

00:12:44.429 --> 00:12:49.121
(Laughter)

00:12:49.145 --> 00:12:50.977
He had no idea what that was.

00:12:51.001 --> 00:12:52.158
(Laughter)

00:12:52.182 --> 00:12:55.006
So I spent an hour trying on
all these damn jeans,

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.125
and I walked out of the store -- truth --

00:12:57.149 --> 00:12:59.857
with the best-fitting jeans
I had ever had.

00:12:59.881 --> 00:13:01.056
I did better.